  (text "POWER SUPPLY - placeholder for your input protection + 5V circuit.\nIN:  VBAT_IN = raw +12V from connector pin 1.   GND = power ground (pins 2 + 24).\nOUT: VBAT = protected +12V. Feeds sensor 5V reg U3 (150 mA max), flex PTC F2, BTS3256D VS pins.\n       Budget ~250 mA. Output load current does not flow through VBAT.\nOUT: +5V = board 5V. ME6211 3V3 LDO (ESP32 WiFi peaks ~350 mA) + TJA1051 (~70 mA). Size for 0.5 A.\nUSB VBUS is diode-ORed into +5V on the main sheet (D4), so the 5V output must tolerate back-feed.\nDelete #FLG01/#FLG02 if your regulator output pin is power_out type (ERC flags two drivers)."
    (at 38.1 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cc4e7364-0224-447d-aaa8-85782caea4b1")
  )
